      "privateNotes": "<p>Fiola focuses on staying mobile while threatening enemies with Unauthorized Exit! and landing Strikes buffed by her Envenom Fangs.</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'gg sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Symbols'\">Fiola is a Maw recreation of Sheas (iruxi monk), who once served as Covalon's City Planner, enforcing the rules and regulations for building houses and businesses. Fiola and Sheas are both deadly fighters with poisonous fangs, but Fiola lacks Sheas's patience, especially when dealing with \"soft ones\" (non-scaled ancestries).</span></p>",
